# DECAL's bytes, exactly as their server sent them.
#
# These files are evidence of what the portal served on the snapshot date, and
# the GELDS artifact is only trustworthy if it can still be re-derived from
# them. Prettier reformatted portal-search.html once — rewriting single-quoted
# attributes to double and wrapping them across lines — which left a committed
# source that no longer produced the committed artifact. `.prettierignore` stops
# that recurring; this stops git's own end-of-line normalisation doing the same
# thing on a checkout, and marks them binary so a re-fetch does not print a
# 17,000-line diff nobody will read.
#
# tests/unit/gelds-artifact.test.ts is the actual guarantee: it re-parses these
# files and asserts they still produce the committed artifact.
supabase/gelds/source/** -text -diff linguist-generated

# Generated, and not worth reviewing as a diff.
supabase/gelds/gelds-*.json -diff linguist-generated
lib/supabase/database.types.ts -diff linguist-generated
pnpm-lock.yaml -diff linguist-generated
